---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base current="about" title="Our story | The Common Squamish" description="The Common brings people together around good work, shared space, and community in downtown Squamish.">
  <header class="page-hd"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow on-dark">Our story</span><h1>Work together.<br />Grow together.</h1><p>How a coworking space on Cleveland Avenue became part of the Squamish community.</p></div></header>

  <section class="founder-section"><div class="wrap founder-grid">
    <div class="founder-copy"><span class="kicker">Since 2017</span><h2>Why Peter opened The Common.</h2><p>Peter Buchholz opened The Common in 2017. He wanted independent workers to have a good place to work and a chance to get to know the people around them.</p><p>Today, remote workers, small teams, and local businesses share the space on Cleveland Avenue. You can come in for an hour or make it part of your regular week.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/community/">Read about the community</a></div>
    <div class="founder-photos"><img class="peter-photo" src="/img/story/peter-buchholz.jpg" alt="Peter Buchholz, founder of The Common" loading="lazy" /><img class="entrance-photo" src="/img/common/photo-15.jpg" alt="The entrance to The Common on Cleveland Avenue" loading="lazy" /><img class="town-photo" src="/img/story/chief-from-courtyard.jpg" alt="View toward the Stawamus Chief from The Common's courtyard" loading="lazy" /></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="workday-section" aria-labelledby="workday-title"><div class="workday-collage" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/story/working-front.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" /><img src="/img/story/working-main.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" /><img src="/img/story/working-window.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="wrap workday-content"><span class="kicker">A day here</span><h2 id="workday-title">What it's like to work here.</h2><p>Pick a desk by the window or settle into the main room. Take a call in the phone booth, make lunch in the kitchen, or step out to the courtyard for a break.</p><p>Book an hour or a day to try it. If the place feels right, there are monthly ways to make it yours.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/day-pass/">Find a desk for your day</a></div></section>

  <section class="name-section"><div class="wrap name-grid"><div class="name-photo"><img src="/img/common/photo-12.jpg" alt="The Common's original wooden sign" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="name-copy"><span class="kicker">More than a name</span><h2>A good place to work can bring people together.</h2><p>That idea is where The Common began. Members have shared lunches, introductions, projects, and plenty of conversations that started at the next desk.</p><p>There is a story behind the name, and it is still being written here in Squamish.</p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/community/">The story behind The Common</a></div></div></section>
</Base>

<style>
  .founder-section{background:var(--paper);padding:clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem) 0}.founder-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,7rem);align-items:center}.founder-copy h2,.workday-content h2,.name-copy h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,4.4rem);letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1.04;margin:.7rem 0 1.4rem}.founder-copy p,.name-copy p{font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1.3rem}.founder-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.18fr .82fr;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;gap:.8rem;min-height:560px}.founder-photos img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.peter-photo{grid-row:1/3;object-position:center 35%}.entrance-photo{object-position:center}.town-photo{object-position:center 32%}
  .workday-section{min-height:760px;position:relative;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:end;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden}.workday-collage{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .9fr 1.05fr;gap:.65rem;background:#153b2a}.workday-collage img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.workday-collage img:first-child{object-position:52% center}.workday-collage img:last-child{object-position:60% center}.workday-section:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(15,34,26,.89),rgba(15,34,26,.53) 55%,rgba(15,34,26,.16)),linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(15,34,26,.5),transparent 55%)}.workday-content{width:100%;padding-block:7rem 5rem}.workday-content .kicker{color:#f4d2ba}.workday-content h2{max-width:670px}.workday-content p{font-size:1.12rem;max-width:560px;color:#f3f5ed}.workday-content .btn{margin-top:1rem;background:#fff;color:var(--forest)}
  .name-section{background:#ebe9df;padding:clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem) 0}.name-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;align-items:center;gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,6rem)}.name-photo{margin-left:max(-4vw,-90px)}.name-photo img{width:100%;height:560px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center}.name-copy{max-width:600px}.name-copy h2{margin-bottom:1.5rem}.name-copy .btn{margin-top:.7rem}
  .founder-photos{gap:0;position:relative;isolation:isolate}
  .founder-photos img{border:8px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 15px 28px #27382b30}
  .founder-photos .peter-photo{transform:rotate(-2deg);z-index:3}
  .founder-photos .entrance-photo{transform:rotate(3deg) translate(-12px,7px);z-index:2}
  .founder-photos .town-photo{transform:rotate(-3deg) translate(-15px,-9px);z-index:1}
  .name-photo{padding:12px 12px 26px;background:#fff;transform:rotate(-2deg);box-shadow:18px 18px 0 #d7c6b0,0 24px 35px #1c30292a}
  @media(max-width:850px){.founder-grid,.name-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.founder-photos{min-height:460px}.name-photo{margin-left:0}.name-photo img{height:360px}.workday-section{min-height:680px}.workday-collage{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.workday-collage img:last-child{display:none}.workday-section:after{background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(15,34,26,.93),rgba(15,34,26,.3) 85%)}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.founder-photos{min-height:400px;gap:.4rem}.founder-copy h2,.workday-content h2,.name-copy h2{font-size:clamp(2.35rem,9vw,3.3rem)}.workday-section{min-height:760px}.workday-collage{display:block}.workday-collage img{position:absolute;inset:0}.workday-collage img:not(:first-child){display:none}.workday-content{padding-block:5rem 3rem}}
</style>
